{{~##
Not Found Body Template - Lumina Theme

Rendered once per site into 404.html at the output root. Web servers serve that file
for any missing URL, so the renderer passes a root-absolute basepath (e.g. "/" or
"/photos/") and every link here must be built from it, never relative.

Expects:
- basepath: Root-absolute path to the site root
- site: { title }
##~}}
<section>
    <h1>{{ html_escape (t 'notfound.title') }}</h1>
    <p>{{ html_escape (t 'notfound.text') }}</p>
    <p><a href="{{ html_escape basepath }}">{{ html_escape (t 'notfound.home') }}</a></p>
</section>
